::  mar/register/bundle: a whole backup in one poke, at /main.sig.
::
::    Carries [wipe=? by=@t bundle] (see +$bundle in lib/register). A
::    noun passthrough: the writer checks the shape under mole, so a
::    foreign or truncated noun refuses instead of booming.
::
|_  n=*
++  grad  %noun
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  n
  --
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  *
  --
--
